Sets the cull face.␀␀␀\–e␀AÀâßbmerge_uniforms(self, uniforms: dict) -> void

Merges the child uniforms into the current uniforms.␀A°ãß·draw_render(what, drawable_width: int, drawable_height: int, projection: Matrix, state_cache: GLStateCache, invert_front_face: bool = False)

Renders `what` to the current OpenGL context.

`what`
    The object to draw. This is usually a Render, but can be a
    GL2Model or a Surface.

`drawable_width`
    The width of the drawable area, in pixels.

`drawable_height`
    The height of the drawable area, in pixels.

`projection`
    The projection matrix to use to transform from view space
    to the viewport.

`state_cache`
    The GL2Draw's GLStateCache, used to avoid redundant GL state
    changes during this render pass.

`invert_front_face`
    If True, the front face is inverted, so that if "cw" is requested, "ccw" is used,
    and vice versa. Used when rendering to a texture.␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀P›e␀¬–e␀¤–e␀,™e␀@še␀˜e␀Aðéß£__pyx_unpickle_GL2Draw(__pyx_type, __pyx_checksum: int, __pyx_state: tuple)␀␀␀␀␀angle, auto_mipmap, clip_cache, clip_rtt_box, color_renderbuffer, color_renderbuffer_1px, current_fbo, default_clip, default_fbo, default_vao, depth_renderbuffer, depth_renderbuffer_1px, did_init, display_info, dpi_scale, draw_per_phys, draw_per_virt, draw_to_virt, draw_transform, drawable_size, drawable_viewport, ever_set_position, fast_redraw_frames, fbo, fbo_1px, fullscreen_surface, gl_extensions, gles, info, last_redraw_time, maximized, old_fullscreen, physical_box, physical_size, redraw_period, shader_cache, state_cache, texture_loader, virt_to_draw, virtual_box, virtual_size, window␀A ïßU__pyx_unpickle_GL2DrawingContext(__pyx_type, __pyx_checksum: int, __pyx_state: tuple)␀A€ðßÑŒ•e␀€•e␀ˆ•e␀␀␀␀␀_child_context, clip_polygon, cull_face, debug, has_depth, height, model_matrix, pixel_perfect, projection_matrix, projectionview_matrix, properties, shaders, state_cache, uniforms, view_matrix, width␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀"␀␀␀ ␀␀␀³␀␀␀!␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀	␀␀␀␀␀␀`␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀
