Predicts properties for a window.

`pd`
    The function that should be called to predict a displayable.␀␀_visit_frame(self, pd)

Predicts properties for a Frame.

`pd`
    The function that should be called to predict a displayable.␀_hover_alt(self)

Returns the value of the alt property in the hover state. Use by button TTS.␀␀inspect(self)

Inspects this style.

Returns a list of (name, properties) pairs for each style, with only
