␀dœH hÓ/Ð/␀ÿÿÿ?ÐyS␀þ␀␀ÿÿÿÿä␀␀␀Given the path to a .py file, return the path to its .pyc file.

    The .py file does not need to exist; this simply returns the path to the
    .pyc file calculated as if the .py file were imported.

    The 'optimization' parameter controls the presumed optimization level of
    the bytecode file. If 'optimization' is not None, the string representation
    of the argument is taken and verified to be alphanumeric (else ValueError
    is raised).

    The debug_override parameter is deprecated. If debug_override is not None,
    a True value is the same as setting 'optimization' to the empty string
    while a False value is equivalent to setting 'optimization' to '1'.

    If sys.implementation.cache_tag is None then NotImplementedError is raised.

    ␀␀ÿÿÿ?ÐyS␀F␀␀␀ÿÿÿÿä␀␀␀the debug_override parameter is deprecated; use 'optimization' instead␀␀ÿÿÿ?ÐyS␀2␀␀␀ÿÿÿÿä␀␀␀debug_override or optimization must be set to None␀␀ÿÿÿ?ÐyS␀$␀␀␀ÿÿÿÿä␀␀␀sys.implementation.cache_tag is None␀␀␀␀ÿÿÿ?ÐyS␀␀␀␀ÿÿÿÿä␀␀␀ is not alphanumeric␀␀␀␀ÿÿÿ?ÐyS␀	␀␀␀ÿÿÿÿä␀␀␀cache_tag␀␀␀ÿÿÿ?ÐyS␀␀␀␀ÿÿÿÿä␀␀␀isalnum␀ÿÿÿ?ÐyS␀␀␀␀ÿÿÿÿä␀␀␀pycache_prefix␀␀ÿÿÿ?ÐyS␀␀␀␀ÿÿÿÿä␀␀␀lstrip␀␀ÿÿÿ?ÐyS␀␀␀␀ÿÿÿÿä␀␀␀debug_override␀␀ÿÿÿ?ÐyS␀␀␀␀ÿÿÿÿä␀␀␀head␀␀␀␀ÿÿÿ?ÐyS␀␀␀␀ÿÿÿÿä␀␀␀rest␀␀␀␀ÿÿÿ?ÐyS␀␀␀␀ÿÿÿÿä␀␀␀almost_filename␀ÿÿÿ?pS␀␀␀␀ÿÿÿÿ            ␀AìæîKÿÿÿ?ÀS␀␀␀␀|´[␀½S␀à±[␀¸]S␀¨]S␀␀¶[␀Œ‡T␀h´[␀4¶[␀€T␀pT␀0T␀h¶[␀´¶[␀Ü¶[␀PT␀AÀçîcÿÿÿ?ÀS␀␀␀␀ø³Y␀@F[␀H²[␀␀[␀l´Y␀ÌSZ␀à¶Y␀„²[␀à”[␀ ´Y␀XéZ␀Ü´Y␀ägT␀Ø¸Y␀Pf[␀ÌUT␀0][␀ø¸Y␀h²[␀[␀À¶Y␀¹Y␀A¬èî3ÿÿÿ?ÀS␀
␀␀␀ŒqT␀è²[␀·[␀8·[␀d·[␀ˆ·[␀¤·[␀Ä±Y␀Ä·[␀ä·[␀AèèîÕ
ÿÿÿ?ÀS␀␀␀␀pT␀€T␀ÿÿÿ?ÐyS␀n␀␀ÿÿÿÿä␀␀␀Given the path to a .pyc. file, return the path to its .py file.

    The .pyc file does not need to exist; this simply returns the path to
    the .py file calculated to correspond to the .pyc file.  If path does
    not conform to PEP 3147/488 format, ValueError will be raised. If
    sys.implementation.cache_tag is None then NotImplementedError is raised.

